# FoldX working directories: gigabytes of .fxout/.pdb intermediates. Regenerable --
# but NOT before list_hashes.py has run, because individual_list.txt lives here and it is
# the only record of what BuildModel actually consumed. See docs/DETERMINISM.md.
# FoldX itself is never redistributable, and neither is its licensed support data. A contributor
# working outside the default directories should not be able to commit any of it by accident.
